class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/85081df9b3ae021e7ea4093acaae6423.poster.avif?t=1787722654\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/85081df9b3ae021e7ea4093acaae6423.webm?t=1787722654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab upgrades mid-run and stack chaotic, over-the-top powers that turn your goofy forest friend into a full-blown nature-powered menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/511c6ba8191855147aca257fcf03d7cc.poster.avif?t=1787722654\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/511c6ba8191855147aca257fcf03d7cc.webm?t=1787722654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weapon to surpass the m.... menace of the fire king! Powered by the forest and questionable engineering. It probably shouldn’t work, but it does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/22eb334ea2f11f1c79ee08ef43a9a191.poster.avif?t=1787722654\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/22eb334ea2f11f1c79ee08ef43a9a191.webm?t=1787722654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, the swarm throws a tantrum and sends in a giant boss. They're huge, unpredictable, and almost always on fire. Oh yeah, did I mention that there's even a bigger baddie at the end of each arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/621c1396da59e080d43842fc0f505b2c.poster.avif?t=1787722654\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/621c1396da59e080d43842fc0f505b2c.webm?t=1787722654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fret not, you have the forest backing you up in the Sanctuary, a place where you can upgrade your powers to be more ridiculous than it is right now... for the right price of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial early access release includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more we lost count</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Funguys Swarm is a cartoony survivor bullet hell where the forest is on fire. Become a Funguy, arm yourself with forest-crafted weapons, and unleash some bonkers powers on the Fireking’s army. And maybe... just maybe, save the day if you’re skilled (or lucky) enough.", "supported_languages": "English, Indonesian, Simplified Chinese, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/855bee5c726bfdfc69